{"find": "with his blood. A hippopotamus when killed in deep water invariably sinks; the body does not rise for several hours, the duration of submersion depending on the temperature of the water. Knowing this, I waited patiently on the bank of the river, and after three hours saw my game rise to the surface.\n\n[[image: A wounded hippopotamus rearing out of the water with open jaws against the side of a long canoe; a white man in a hat aims a rifle at it while African paddlers crowd the canoe]]\n[[caption]] He struck the canoe a blow which nearly capsized it.\n", "replace": "with his blood. A hippopotamus when killed in deep water invariably sinks; the body does not rise for several hours, the duration of submersion depending on the temperature of the water. Knowing this, I waited patiently on the bank of the river, and after three hours saw my game rise to the surface.\n"}